usage: ladon [-h] [--repo-root REPO_ROOT] [--root ANALYSIS_ROOTS]
             [--scope {changed-set,closure,inventory,multi-root,namespace,owner}]
             [--changed-path CHANGED_PATH]
             [--changed-manifest CHANGED_MANIFEST] [--max-modules MAX_MODULES]
             [--max-context-modules MAX_CONTEXT_MODULES]
             [--cache-dir CACHE_DIR] [--no-cache] [--build]
             [--build-timeout BUILD_TIMEOUT]
             [--extraction-backend {text,lean}]
             [--lean-extraction-scope {root,inventory}]
             [--lean-cache-dir LEAN_CACHE_DIR]
             [--lean-batch-size LEAN_BATCH_SIZE] [--lean-timeout LEAN_TIMEOUT]
             [--lean-strict] [--progress {auto,plain,json,off}]
             [--overall-timeout OVERALL_TIMEOUT] [--max-rss-mib MAX_RSS_MIB]
             [--max-report-bytes MAX_REPORT_BYTES] [--format {text,json}]
             [--output OUTPUT] [--emit FORMAT=PATH]
             [--report-version {v3,v2,v1}]
             [--projection {summary,review,full}] [--output-json LEGACY_JSON]
             [--output-text LEGACY_TEXT] [--fail-on FAIL_ON]
             [--generated-at-utc GENERATED_AT_UTC] [--doc-file DOC_FILE]
             [--packet-dir PACKET_DIR]
             [--architecture-policy ARCHITECTURE_POLICY]
             [--source-pattern-policy SOURCE_PATTERN_POLICY]
             [--generated-family-policy GENERATED_FAMILY_POLICY]
             [--generated-family-candidate-profile GENERATED_FAMILY_CANDIDATE_PROFILE]
             [--module-system-witness MODULE_SYSTEM_WITNESS]
             [--import-diet-witness IMPORT_DIET_WITNESS]
             [--proof-xray PROOF_XRAY]
             [--packet-profile {generic,review_packet,witness_bundle,release_bundle}]
             [--verify-export-surface]
             [--certificate-artifact CERTIFICATE_ARTIFACT]
             [target]

Ladon clean-core Lean analyzer

positional arguments:
  target                Optional analysis root alias

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --repo-root REPO_ROOT
                        Repository root to analyze
  --root ANALYSIS_ROOTS
                        Lean root file or module; repeat for multi-root scope.
  --scope {changed-set,closure,inventory,multi-root,namespace,owner}
                        Primary/context population contract; owner is the
                        ordinary default.
  --changed-path CHANGED_PATH
  --changed-manifest CHANGED_MANIFEST
  --max-modules MAX_MODULES
  --max-context-modules MAX_CONTEXT_MODULES
  --cache-dir CACHE_DIR
                        Source-index cache directory; defaults to the platform
                        user cache.
  --no-cache            Bypass source-index reads and writes for this
                        analysis.
  --build               Run the target repository's lake build before
                        dependent analysis.
  --build-timeout BUILD_TIMEOUT
                        Finite Lake build deadline in seconds.
  --extraction-backend {text,lean}
                        Select text-only discovery or Lean-backed extraction.
                        The Lean backend loads target environments and is
                        unsafe for untrusted repositories.
  --lean-extraction-scope {root,inventory}
  --lean-cache-dir LEAN_CACHE_DIR
                        Optional cache directory for Lean helper JSON payloads
  --lean-batch-size LEAN_BATCH_SIZE
                        Modules per bounded Lean inventory helper invocation
                        (minimum 2).
  --lean-timeout LEAN_TIMEOUT
                        Finite deadline in seconds for each Lean helper batch.
  --lean-strict         Reject partial Lean batches while preserving their
                        rows and diagnostics.
  --progress {auto,plain,json,off}
                        Emit long-run progress on stderr; auto is interactive-
                        only.
  --overall-timeout OVERALL_TIMEOUT
                        Optional finite deadline for the complete analysis in
                        seconds.
  --max-rss-mib MAX_RSS_MIB
                        Optional supported process-tree resident-memory limit
                        in MiB.
  --max-report-bytes MAX_REPORT_BYTES
                        Optional maximum bytes for each selected report
                        representation.
  --format {text,json}
  --output OUTPUT       Report path, or - for standard output.
  --emit FORMAT=PATH    Add an output destination; repeat for multiple report
                        formats.
  --report-version {v3,v2,v1}
                        JSON report major. Canonical output defaults to v3;
                        deprecated --json/--text output retains v2 unless
                        selected explicitly.
  --projection {summary,review,full}
                        Report-v3 projection; review is the ordinary default.
  --output-json LEGACY_JSON, --json LEGACY_JSON
  --output-text LEGACY_TEXT, --text LEGACY_TEXT
  --fail-on FAIL_ON     Repeatable kind:<kind>, severity:<minimum>, or
                        phase:<name>:<skipped|partial> selector.
  --generated-at-utc GENERATED_AT_UTC
  --doc-file DOC_FILE
  --packet-dir PACKET_DIR
  --architecture-policy ARCHITECTURE_POLICY
                        Optional JSON policy defining project-specific module
                        groups and forbidden imports.
  --source-pattern-policy SOURCE_PATTERN_POLICY
                        Optional JSON policy defining project-specific source
                        text patterns to report.
  --generated-family-policy GENERATED_FAMILY_POLICY
                        Optional versioned JSON policy defining project-
                        generated source families and quoted provenance.
  --generated-family-candidate-profile GENERATED_FAMILY_CANDIDATE_PROFILE
                        Optional strict versioned profile for advisory
                        generated-family candidate detection.
  --module-system-witness MODULE_SYSTEM_WITNESS
                        Optional JSON witness quoting Lean module-system
                        boundary evidence.
  --import-diet-witness IMPORT_DIET_WITNESS
                        Optional JSON witness quoting Lean/Lake import
                        minimization evidence.
  --proof-xray PROOF_XRAY
                        Optional JSON witness quoting elaborated proof-shape
                        evidence.
  --packet-profile {generic,review_packet,witness_bundle,release_bundle}
                        Evidence profile used for --packet-dir summaries.
  --verify-export-surface
  --certificate-artifact CERTIFICATE_ARTIFACT

commands:
  doctor    Emit read-only installation and repository readiness diagnostics.
  result    Validate an experimental result manifest without loading Lean evidence.
  theorem   Plan, materialize, and independently replay theorem capsules.
  proof-search  Build and query local Lean proof-navigation evidence.
  proofir       Validate, canonicalize, or inspect ProofIR artifacts.
  runset    Execute a versioned set of ordinary analyses.
  preview   Resolve roots, scope, policies, and costs without target execution.
  inspect   Inspect canonical rows from one existing report or source index.
  findings  List, filter, or inspect findings from one existing report.
  atlas     Build an atlas from reports or a runset bundle.
  query     Run a canned query against an atlas SQLite database.
  diff      Compare two explicit atlas files structurally.
  cards     Render reviewer cards from an atlas.
  workflow  Build a combined atlas review workflow.

Run 'ladon COMMAND --help' for command-specific options.
